# Build context for backend/Dockerfile is the repo root: send only what the
# API image needs. Never send .env or runtime data.
*
!backend/
!eval/results/*.json
backend/.venv
backend/data
backend/tests
# ...except the fixtures: the fake adapters read their canned articles and
# scripts from here, and the no-keys demo (docker-compose.fake.yml) needs them.
!backend/tests/fixtures
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
